IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-scope`
IMPORT `P2-section-2-gate`
IMPORT `P2-annex-iv`

-- Tests of P2-annex-iv.l4. Every expected value is written by hand from the text (the quoted line above each function), never from the code's output.
-- Argument order of a gated function: the date asked, the AI system, the harmonisation facts, then the facts of the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`Annex IV test the Annex III system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Annex IV test the Annex I system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Annex IV test the system placed earlier` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Annex IV test the system placed earlier and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE
`Annex IV test the system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS FALSE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE
`Annex IV test Section B products facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS TRUE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS FALSE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE
`Annex IV test Section A equivalent facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS TRUE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS TRUE
`Annex IV test Section A equivalent but overall protection reduced facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS TRUE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE


§ `Annex IV, points 1 to 9`

-- Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 1 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex III system
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day after
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 3 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex I system (Art 113(c)(ii)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 1 8 2028) `Annex IV test the Annex I system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 8 2028) `Annex IV test the Annex I system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the last day of the text as enacted: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 26 7 2026) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the first day of the text as amended: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 27 7 2026) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application and not significantly changed, so saved
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2030) `Annex IV test the system placed earlier` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): the same system after a significant change in its design is covered
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2030) `Annex IV test the system placed earlier and changed` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a high-risk AI system: no date of application, not covered
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2030) `Annex IV test the system that is not high-risk` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 2(2): an Article 6(1) system related to Section B products meets only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 8 2028) `Annex IV test the Annex I system` `Annex IV test Section B products facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Art 2(2) reaches only the Article 6(1) route: an Annex III system related to Section B products is not cut off
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test Section B products facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Art 2(13): the application of Articles 9 to 15 may be limited where Section A legislation gives equivalent protection and the overall level is not reduced
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 8 2028) `Annex IV test the Annex I system` `Annex IV test Section A equivalent facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 2(13)(b) fails (the limitation would reduce the overall level of protection): the requirement applies in full
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 8 2028) `Annex IV test the Annex I system` `Annex IV test Section A equivalent but overall protection reduced facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Art 2(13) reaches only the Article 6(1) route: an Annex III system is not limited
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test Section A equivalent facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains its intended purpose, the name of the provider and the version of the system reflecting its relation to previous versions
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains how the AI system interacts with, or can be used to interact with, hardware or software, including with other AI systems, that are not part of the AI system itself, where applicable
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the versions of relevant software or firmware, and any requirements related to version updates
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the description of all the forms in which the AI system is placed on the market or put into service, such as software packages embedded into hardware, downloads, or APIs
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the description of the hardware on which the AI system is intended to run
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains where the AI system is a component of products, photographs or illustrations showing external features, the marking and internal layout of those products
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains a basic description of the user-interface provided to the deployer
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains instructions for use for the deployer, and a basic description of the user-interface provided to the deployer, where applicable
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

