#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
