#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the methods and steps performed for the development of the AI system, including, where relevant, recourse to pre-trained systems or tools provided by third parties and how those were used, integrated or modified by the provider
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
