-- not met: the technical documentation contains the key design choices including the rationale and assumptions made, including with regard to persons or groups of persons in respect of who the system is intended to be used
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the main classification choices
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains what the system is designed to optimise for, and the relevance of the different parameters
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the description of the expected output and output quality of the system
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the decisions about any possible trade-off made regarding the technical solutions adopted to comply with the requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the description of the system architecture explaining how software components build on or feed into each other and integrate into the overall processing
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the computational resources used to develop, train, test and validate the AI system
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains where relevant, the data requirements in terms of datasheets describing the training methodologies and techniques and the training data sets used, including a general description of these data sets, information about their provenance, scope and main characteristics; how the data was obtained and selected; labelling procedures (e.g. for supervised learning), data cleaning methodologies (e.g. outliers detection)
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains an assessment of the human oversight measures needed in accordance with Article 14, including an assessment of the technical measures needed to facilitate the interpretation of the outputs of AI systems by the deployers, in accordance with Article 13(3), point (d)
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains where applicable, a detailed description of pre-determined changes to the AI system and its performance, together with all the relevant information related to the technical solutions adopted to ensure continuous compliance of the AI system with the relevant requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the validation and testing procedures used, including information about the validation and testing data used and their main characteristics
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the metrics used to measure accuracy, robustness and compliance with other relevant requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2, as well as potentially discriminatory impacts
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains test logs and all test reports dated and signed by the responsible persons, including with regard to pre-determined changes as referred to under point (f)
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains cybersecurity measures put in place
#ASSERT `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` (Date 2 12 2027) `Annex IV test the Annex III system` `Annex IV test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

